          "text": "Left ear pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Ongoing for 5 days; dull ache, about 4/10 at baseline and up to 6/10 when lying on the left side. Worse at night and with pinna movement, over-ear headphones, or a tight headband; improved with simple analgesia and avoiding pressure."
